    "type": "question",
    "label": "8",
    "prompt": "When a particular fraction is added to itself, the result is $\\frac13$. What is the original fraction?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac16$",
      "worked": "The two equal fractions each make half of $\\frac13$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac13&=\\frac26\\\\\\frac16+\\frac16&=\\frac26\\\\\\frac16+\\frac16&=\\frac13\\end{align*}$$\nThe original fraction is $\\frac16$.",
